research/audit/wave8-real-analysis-absolute-convergence.provenance.jsonl-15-{"id":"thm-double-series-fubini","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-altered","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://web.math.princeton.edu/~gunning/bk.pdf","https://www.math.ucdavis.edu/~hunter/intro_analysis_pdf/ch4.pdf"],"rationale":"The cited Princeton text gives the exact absolute double-series theorem and equality of both iterated sums; the proof is adapted to the library's enumeration.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
