research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement.log-4112-convergence, and it is not sufficient. What decides the matter for nonnegative
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement.log:4113:$p_k$ is [[thm-infinite-product-criterion]]: $\prod(1+p_k)$ converges if and only
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-page-absolute-convergence-and-rearrangement.log-4114-if $\sum p_k$ converges.
